{"id":"nespravedlivo","lemma":"несправедливо","pos":"adv","rank":1859,"glosses":["unjustly, unfairly (in an unjust manner)"],"examples":[{"text":"Это было несправедливо.","en":"It was unjust.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/787191","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Я думаю, что это несправедливо.","en":"I think it's unfair.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"why"]]},{"text":"Это несправедливо, и вы это знаете.","en":"That's not fair and you know it.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"По-моему, это несправедливо.","en":"I think it's unfair.","words":[{"g":"along / by"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Ты же знаешь, что это несправедливо.","en":"You know this isn't fair.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"(emphasis)"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"why"]]}]}